{"schema_version":"1.0","source_id":"vllm__pr__42430","repo":"vllm-project/vllm","source_type":"pull_request","number":42430,"url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/42430","title":"[Bugfix] mamba: run single-token extends as decodes","survey":{"categories":["bug_fix"],"endorsement_count":1,"endorsements":[{"reason":"The bug can only manifest in very particular circumstances: NIXL Disagg + mamba model + Full CG enabled, and it is the confluence of different systems interacting in a complex way. It is hard to look at the code and understand the bug statically [especially since no exception is thrown]. The fix is neat: it relies on a single token prefill being equivalent to a mamba decode [if not the first token], and this way it doesn't sacrifice the perf of the whole batch (by e.g. forcing mixed CG instead of this fix).","effort_raw":"4 days"}]},"github_snapshot":{"as_of":"2026-08-08","state":"merged","base_sha":"737bfa3a43ce386bd1894792f3302d9f3f9d73fa","head_sha":"7e6eadcf30fe8405db6eea184cd8444743316e7f","merge_commit_sha":"47829b1159335a010521ea3e5361d51744a36b0a","commits":6,"changed_files":4,"additions":120,"deletions":21},"benchmark":{"value":"high","readiness":"needs_reproduction","task_families":["debugging","distributed_serving","mamba","cuda_graph"],"signals":["rare_configuration_conjunction","silent_wrong_behavior","cross_system_interaction","performance_preserving_fix"],"blockers":["nixl_disaggregation_testbed","mamba_model_and_full_cuda_graph"]}}
